                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "okay so this game is cool but it has problems .\r\n\r\nthe biggest problem in this game is the camera , its really hard to know when to slide or when to hit .\r\ngame is also really fast . but dont consider it to be a superhard game.\r\nso much going on , but this game has a lot of content \r\n\r\nand also for online , the online mode is not good. you can only create rooms. there are no option for joining other seasions or search for other rooms. like soul calibur 6 or many other good fighting games. so in 2026 this game is only worth if you play offline.\r\n\r\nwhich is kinda sad cause we need more games like this. battle royale fighting games are fun!  you can play from 1-4 players.\r\n\r\ndont think the camera is a me thing or skill issue. its just a badly designed camera. but not all games are perfect you can still enjoy this game for what it is.",
